# Synced from bootstrap: macos/tools/ssh/files/.ssh/config.identity.tmpl. Do not edit this file.
# The next sync writes it again, and each change in this file is lost.
# Personal ssh defaults, included inside `Host *` from config (so no Host line).
# A template: rendered by bootstrap mac sync from user in [tools.ssh] of macos.toml.
User <% index .config "user" | required "ssh: set user in [tools.ssh] of macos.toml" %>
